This is not going to work. `GEN-*` can only be a parameter value that you use in the template. So to achieve this you would need something like the following:

```json
"serverName": {
  "value": "GEN-UNIQUE"
},
"targetProperties": {
  "value": {
    "targetType": "SqlDb",
    ...
   "connectionServerName": "[concat(parameters('serverName'), 'database.windows.net')]"
  }
}
```

Separately, you should not be generating subscription GUIDs and resourceGroup names randomly. You should instead use the [`resourceId()`](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-resource-manager/templates/template-functions-resource#resourceid) function inside of the template instead of constructing it yourself as a parameter value. The `resourceId()` function will use the subscription and resourceGroup context of the current deployment unless you need to override, but even then it should not be random.
